---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Blog
intro: Notes on building products, teaching, and putting AI to work, written as I learn.
description: Writing by David DeWinter on product, building, and practical AI.
permalink: /blog/
---
{%- if collections.posts.length %}
<ul class="post-list">
  {%- for post in collections.posts %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ post.url }}">
      <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
      <div>
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}{% if post.data.draft %} <span class="tag tag-draft">Draft</span>{% endif %}</h3>
        {%- if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
<p class="form-note" style="margin-top:1.5rem">Follow along with the <a href="/feed.xml">RSS feed</a>.</p>
{%- else %}
<p class="empty-state">No posts yet. The first one is on its way.</p>
{%- endif %}
